# Loiter > Circles: loitercirclesToolStripMenuItem_Click (GCSViews/FlightPlanner.cs:4743). Asks
# "Loiter Turns", offering 3, and appends a LOITER_TURNS (18) at the click with the turns in Param1.

env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml
screen plan
window 1600x1200
budget 3

# The map first: a press before its first paint records nothing.
expect map.ready true
click map@0.45x0.40:right
click menu-loiter
click menu-loitercircles
expect plan.prompt Loiter Turns
expect plan.prompt.value 3
key Return
expect mission.items 1
expect mission.last.command 18
expect mission.last.p1 3
expect mission.last.position true
